  "description": "<h3>Dominate Every Trail with the D5 Electric Fat Tire Mountain Bike</h3>\n<p>750W Fat ebike Engineered for Mountain Warriors</p>\n<p>\ud83c\udfc6 \"Best Value Mountain ebike 2025\" - OutdoorGear Lab</p>\n<p>\ud83d\ude9a Free Shipping | \ud83d\udd27 2-Year Warranty | \ud83d\udd04 15-Day Returns</p>\n<h3>Why Mountain Riders Choose D5</h3>\n<p>\u26f0\ufe0f Conquer Technical Terrain</p>\n<p>4.0\" Kenda fat tires + 95mm suspension eat rocks for breakfast</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7bZ_JgVGGe0\">Watch Mountain Test \u2192</a></p>\n<p>\ud83d\udd0b 80-Mile Range</p>\n<p>48V Samsung battery lasts 3X longer than standard mountain ebikes</p>\n<h3>Built for Fat ebike Adventures</h3>\n<h4>Winter Warrior Ready</h4>\n<p>Our 26\u00d74.0\" electric fat bike dominates:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\u2744\ufe0f Snow-packed forest trails</li>\n<li>\ud83c\udfd6\ufe0f Deep sand beaches</li>\n<li>\ud83c\udf27\ufe0f Muddy mountain passes</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\"D5 handles snow better than my 4X4 truck!\" - Mike, Colorado Rider</p>\n<p><strong>\"Age has been slowing me down but with this HIMI-ebike I'm back in the game\"</strong> - Over 40 Rider</p>\n<h3>Mountain ebike Technology</h3>\n<h4>Pro-Grade Components</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Shimano Altus 7-Speed:</strong> Perfect gear range for 15%+ climbs</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Tektro Hydraulic Brakes:</strong> 180mm rotors stop on dime</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Torque Sensor:</strong> Instant 85Nm power when you need it</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Your Mountain Awaits</h3>\n<h4>Ready to Ride?</h4>\n<p>\ud83d\udeb4\u2642\ufe0f 10000+ Riders Configured</p>\n<p>5'3\" to 6'5\" Rider Friendly</p>"
